digraph account_payable_process_75 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_8ELN" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_8ELN"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_8ELN" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_8ELN" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_AG0Z" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_AG0Z"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_AG0Z" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_AG0Z" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_AG0Z" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_AG0Z"
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_AG0Z"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_8ELN" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_AG0Z" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_8ELN"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_8ELN"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_8ELN" -> "create voucher for the documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"create voucher for the documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the receiving department. 
When sending to the receiving department is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: gathering the receiving report and confirming all documents have been amended. 
When gathering the receiving report is completed, the next tasks should be gathering the vendors invoice and doubling check a three-way match, they should be done in parallel. 
When gathering the vendors invoice is completed, you need to report errors to relevant team member.
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then you need to create voucher for the documents.
The process is now completed. 
"
}
